{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/400758-hypothetical-malfeas-lunars","id":400758,"title":"Hypothetical Malfeas Lunars","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Lunar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-02-10T13:19:42-08:00","id":400758,"title":"Hypothetical Malfeas Lunars","content":"The Yozi, somehow, manage to get their whatever geography has instead of hands onto a few dozen Lunar Exaltations, and they run them through the &quot;Green Sun Prince&quot; treatment<br /> <br /> Assuming that it's like what we've seen of 3E Infernals, and all the yozi contributed instead of just a single Yozi per caste.<br /> <br /> What would they be like? 3 castes or five? Tattoos? Would they have spirit shapes, and if so, what would they be like?<br /> <br /> What would their charms be like?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm an aspergic individual. This means that I can't imagine how others will react to situations. This has led to me accidentally offending someone, and has also led to me being less clear in statements than I thought I was. I'd like to apologize, and ask that others don't get mad, but just ask me to reword or clarify. Thank you","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3405-rater202","name":"Rater202","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"521"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-10T13:21:50-08:00","id":400783,"title":"","content":"Spirit shape: 1CDs","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Chicanery-No: If a player uses this Charm in an abusive or exploitative manner, the ST may punch him right in the goddamn face.&quot; --TheDementedOne<br /> <br /> &quot;Happiness is <i>very</i> brittle and short-lived in the Exalted community, because <i>ressentiment</i> is our cultural touchstone.&quot; --Gayo","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3420-zelbinnean","name":"Zelbinnean","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5884"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-10T13:25:56-08:00","id":400789,"title":"","content":"You remember that artifact that let a person trade their arm for basically a swiss army knife of weapons? That would be a melee charm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-10T13:39:40-08:00","id":400802,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zelbinnean</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/400758-hypothetical-malfeas-lunars?p=400783#post400783\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Spirit shape: 1CDs</div> </div> </div> </div>Not literally, I expect, but totemic forms resembling 1CDs? Or Maybe combinations of traits from demons? Or maybe it's still Animals, but the Malfeas Lunars get some demonic mutations that are added on top of the Spirit Shape?(though I expect it'd be pretty easy to recreate some 1CD-Blood Apes are just gorillas with horns and claws, and there are multiple yozi with giant spider shaped 1CDs)<br /> <br /> Demonic shapes being easiest to assume-maybe even being able to use Certain Demonic charms while in Demon Shape, in liu of normal Lunars being able to learn &quot;Animal Techniques&quot;<br /> <br /> I imagine that the strength and stamina charms that a normal lunar has, that let them augment their natural weapons with moonsilver blades or depend themselves with a moonsilver carapace, if they carry over to 3E, would probably have.., I don't want to say Mirrors, but similar charms, in the Malfeas Lunars, that use either malfean brass or vitriolic moonsilver(if vitriol carries over and retain it's properties.)<br /> <br /> I Expect that non demonic forms might be augmented, either automatically or by charm, with Demonic Mutations, and I expect War Forms would be terrifying.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm an aspergic individual. This means that I can't imagine how others will react to situations. This has led to me accidentally offending someone, and has also led to me being less clear in statements than I thought I was. I'd like to apologize, and ask that others don't get mad, but just ask me to reword or clarify. Thank you","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3405-rater202","name":"Rater202","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"521"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-10T16:35:28-08:00","id":400988,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rater202</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/400758-hypothetical-malfeas-lunars#post400758\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Yozi, somehow, manage to get their whatever geography has instead of hands onto a few dozen Lunar Exaltations, and they run them through the &quot;Green Sun Prince&quot; treatment</div> </div> </div> </div>Exaltation eats the Yozi junk poured into it, turns back into a Lunar Exaltation.<br /> Similar things would happen during attempts by the Neverborn.<br /> <br /> Altering a Lunar Exaltation is easy, making it stick is quite a bit harder. I have no idea what sort of shit would go down if said Shard was put into a person while it was still Yozified though.<br /> <br /> <br /> Shit would get weird though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-10T19:21:26-08:00","id":401311,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SachKreiosLucy4</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Eating the junk isn't a great defense - considering that Lunars <b><i>turn into</i></b>the things they eat the heartsblood of.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, but they can turn right back from that form.<br /> <br /> Change is the Lunar Exaltation's playground, it alters their hosts in ways no other Exaltation can lay claim to. Thus, they're going to be a lot harder to permanently alter than a Solar Shard.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-10T20:12:15-08:00","id":401343,"title":"","content":"Testing testing.<br /> <br /> I can see you quoted me.<br /> <br /> But my post is deleted? O_o","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4946-sachkreioslucy4","name":"SachKreiosLucy4","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4946_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-11T08:21:15-08:00","id":401918,"title":"","content":"The malfean lunar tattoos would be combination between the Green Sun Tattoo, the Demon ink tattoos and the unwoven coaducater. The tattoos would have the benefits of green sun tattoos but would also have the essence of the coaducater weaved into them li