ntainer\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert Vance</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/400758-hypothetical-malfeas-lunars?p=403970#post403970\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No, I just didn't come down with any definitive details on them, leaving them as a blank slate. I have vague sketches of them in my head and wish I'd had the chance to develop them\u2014they wouldn't make sense outside Gunstar's context\u2014but it's not like I've got them written up and tied with a bow.</div> </div> </div> </div>Bah and humbug! If they can capture some solar exaltations and twist them then they can capture other exaltations and twist them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-12T19:08:53-08:00","id":404003,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mizu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/400758-hypothetical-malfeas-lunars?p=404001#post404001\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Bah and humbug! If they can capture some solar exaltations and twist them then they can capture other exaltations and twist them.</div> </div> </div> </div>More as in &quot;these Exalted are specifically designed to be cool antagonists because of the way they work within this specific setting.&quot; One would fall apart without that context, while the other is tied to things that don't exist outside of the setting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/527-robert-vance","name":"Robert Vance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar527_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-12T20:09:16-08:00","id":404032,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gallus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/400758-hypothetical-malfeas-lunars?p=403930#post403930\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is...<i>this</i> what happens when you make Green Moon Princes?</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually, I believe Kimberry has a Demon who manifests as a blood red moon.<br /> Sometime the Red Moon and Green Sun get together and have hanky panky. So it still fits.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4946-sachkreioslucy4","name":"SachKreiosLucy4","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4946_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-12T22:08:00-08:00","id":404121,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert Vance</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/400758-hypothetical-malfeas-lunars?p=403970#post403970\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No, I just didn't come down with any definitive details on them, leaving them as a blank slate. I have vague sketches of them in my head and wish I'd had the chance to develop them\u2014they wouldn't make sense outside Gunstar's context\u2014but it's not like I've got them written up and tied with a bow.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't suppose you'd be allowed to share those vague sketches with us? You've got me curious now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-12T22:18:21-08:00","id":404125,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/400758-hypothetical-malfeas-lunars?p=404121#post404121\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I don't suppose you'd be allowed to share those vague sketches with us? You've got me curious now.</div> </div> </div> </div>The new moon Incarnae is a nightmare-goddess, somewhere between Hecate and Morpheus. Their Chosen attack the Gunstar through dreams, waging a campaign of &quot;psychic warfare&quot; to complement the direct assaults carried out by the Green Sun Princes. They basically exist to draw you into weird and scary dream sequences. I've got some very baroque Charm mechanics they use to do this, but they probably work best as a Storyteller-only thing. <br /> <br /> The Chosen of the Stars draw power not from the mere suns, but from the starry emanations of the divine infinity of the Primordials. Their magic uses goetic seals and binding spells to impose alien order on the world. They're selling an alternative to the Sidereal's Fate\u2014something esoteric and transcendent, grander than mere causation and entirely possibly bullshit. If I'd known about Getimians then, I'd probably have explicitly put them in instead, although that would require some changes to the backstory.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/527-robert-vance","name":"Robert Vance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar527_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-12T22:43:22-08:00","id":404151,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert Vance</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/400758-hypothetical-malfeas-lunars?p=404125#post404125\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The new moon Incarnae is a nightmare-goddess, somewhere between Hecate and Morpheus. Their Chosen attack the Gunstar through dreams, waging a campaign of &quot;psychic warfare&quot; to complement the direct assaults carried out by the Green Sun Princes. They basically exist to draw you into weird and scary dream sequences. I've got some very baroque Charm mechanics they use to do this, but they probably work best as a Storyteller-only thing.<br /> <br /> The Chosen of the Stars draw power not from the mere suns, but from the starry emanations of the divine infinity of the Primordials. Their magic uses goetic seals and binding spells to impose alien order on the world. They're selling an alternative to the Sidereal's Fate\u2014something esoteric and transcendent, grander than mere causation and entirely possibly bullshit. If I'd known about Getimians then, I'd probably have explicitly put them in instead, although that would require some changes to the backstory.</div> </div> </div> </div>Why does Hecate work so well in space? In a primer I wrote for a Heaven's Reach game that never got off the ground one of my overarching antagonists was the Tomb-Star, Hecatean Queen of Wings, whose discarded and collapsed factory moons were portals into her screaming dreamscape mind.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1522-turkeygiant","name":"turkeygiant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1522_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"999"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-12T22:45:30-08:00","id":404152,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert Vance</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/400758-hypothetical-malfeas-lunars?p=404125#post404125\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The new moon Incarnae is a nightmare-goddess, somewhere between Hecate and Morpheus. Their Chosen attack the Gunstar through dreams, waging a campaign of &quot;psychic warfare&quot; to complement the direct assaults carried out by the Green Sun Princes. They basically exist to draw you into weird and scary dream sequences. I've got some very baroque Charm mechanics they use to do this, but they probably work best as a Storyteller-only thing.</div> </div> </div> </div>So... F